   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SHC 2008-11</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">SHC Serbia 2008-11</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projekett syftar till att &#xF6;ka respekten f&#xF6;r m&#xE4;nskliga r&#xE4;ttigheter, genom att str&#xE4;ka kapacviteten hos loakla organisationer samt ge st&#xF6;d till &quot;civil rights defenders&quot;</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of SHC is to contribute to an increased respect for human rights and thereby to contribute to the building of democracy. To achieve this goal the focus of SHC has three programmes:  Strenghtening of the Rule of Law, Strenghtening of the Freedom of Expression and Protection against Discrimination.</narrative>
  </description>
